  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Deathwatch Support",
    "summary": "Each friendly **KILL TEAM** unit that has this ability gains 3 abilities, each working while the named doctrine is active for it:\n\n- **Furor Tactics** (**devastator doctrine**): its attacks gain **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**.\n- **Malleus Tactics** (**tactical doctrine**): its attacks gain **[[LETHAL HITS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/lethal-hits)**.\n- **Purgatus Tactics** (**assault doctrine**): its attacks targeting enemy units up to 9\" away from it gain **[[PRECISION]](vsdata:weapon-ability/precision)**.\n\nRules for **DEATHWATCH** allies:\n\n- You may include **DEATHWATCH** units even if their Chapter faction keyword differs from the rest of your army, up to 500 points combined.\n- Unless a rule says otherwise, you cannot pick a **DEATHWATCH** model as your **WARLORD** when mustering.\n- **KILL TEAM** units can take Enhancements only from this detachment.\n\nThese are exceptions to the army rules for Space Marine Chapters.",
